  "teaching": {
    "induction": "给出 inform、reform、transform、uniform、conform 五个词，问：共同的「形状」在哪里？前缀把「形状」改成了什么状态？",
    "transfer": {
      "word": "transformative",
      "question": "拆开并猜义：trans- + form + -ative 描述的是哪一种改变？",
      "answer": "trans- 越过 + form 形状 + -ative …的 → 能跨到另一种形态、带来根本改变的。例句：The discovery was transformative for the field of materials science."
    }
